{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260601_100739_p37_b17", "persona_id": "db:37", "outcome": "FOLLOW_UP", "content": "4. 重复使用同一类证据（如社交帖子）会降低效果，应结合不同证据类型（如保修文件、实物演示）。", "difficulty_rating": 6, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260601_101641"}
